=== clearing
~ var:forecast = "stormy"
The weather is {var:weather}.
The forecast is {var:forecast}.
* [Watch the storm arrive] { var:remembered-weather = var:weather; var:weather = var:forecast } -> shelter

=== shelter
It was {var:remembered-weather}. Now it is {var:weather}.
{if var:weather == "stormy"}Rain drums on the roof.{/if}
{if var:weather != var:remembered-weather}You are glad you found shelter.{/if}
* [Wait for clear skies] { var:weather = "sunny" } -> clearing
* [Stay here] -> END
